{{- define "architecture-reviewer-tools" -}}

ARCHITECTURE REVIEWER TOOLS:
- {{binaryName}} get — Query task state to inspect output[] entries
  {{binaryName}} get {{.TaskID}} --json
- {{binaryName}} submit-verdict — Submit review verdict (use the single VERDICT SUBMISSION recipe below)
- {{binaryName}} await-resubmission — Block until doer resubmits after rejection (call after submit-verdict REJECTED)
  {{binaryName}} await-resubmission {{.TaskID}} --agent-id {{.AgentID}} --json
  On RESUBMITTED, use the returned `base_commit` and `review_commit` for every diff command in this same session.
  After reviewing that boundary, also substitute its full `review_commit` in the next submit-verdict command. Never reuse the initial SHA for revised work.
{{- end -}}
